<description>&lt;p&gt;Violence continues in Thailand's southern provinces, with Thai forces confronting attacks that include torched surveillance cameras and burnt tyres in Narathiwat. Thailand is demanding action from Myanmar on mining waste that pollutes rivers, while a building fire in southern Thailand killed 11 people. Cambodia's Prime Minister Hun Manet used the Francophonie summit to accuse Thailand of occupying Cambodian land and called for resuming border demarcation, prompting Thai army accusations that Cambodia is politicising a border temple display. The conflict recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE5YcTRxVFcwTkZMUzkyNnhCN2JzSEg5ZjhncTR1d1RpWG1hMS1zTVlqSzd4aWd4UDY2U1NRLWVhSDY4WVZPdkZja2dmSnB2cHpvVHdzV1dyRzdQbEJpUS12WHRKS0owT0k3VDZfalFn?oc=5&quot;&gt;CGTN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNZkdNU29aeTFRTGI1S2c1UDJtTzV1dlFUVVZqV3dvNzhLWUVqX204ejZOTXN4MDRKb05STjhxZHdIeTliWEJYdDF0SGtYMXhSUUplbDdLclNBY3dRZC1tNmI3dWZheU0tSGs1Rkl6SlVYd1l4Qi1ucjhVRWJYZTB1S18zLTFISHd2OWFoOFhDUmpWZkNHd1l5Q0cxRl9ONVQxaG5wQjNYRks1MUx0Wk4zY2h2SU5mVmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;PYMNTS.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOeldWTTRRMnJ5cU5faG8ydlhfZmdLdDhRQ1E2dGxWNFJPT2Q4MFo5ajdsd2NycW5HZngzalFobm9kcEZBcGxJNWtPMDF3Z1gyd0lpQTlac0wzS0EzYi1FeTRLY3p5Rjl1SVdiYXItdTlhSFE2eWhISURmeXZwV3JvdWk3SmE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Borneo Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPcVpmSDQ5M216NjRVRGEtZnN5NEZMQTRvaWFFS0tZSEQ2aFZWZHhzanl4cWtlWmFIbnZkdFBHNjY4QUhWTXh5XzcycHBTVjA1cDVRd01VN2pYLUlKdzV4RDRXWkFZVlh6T3M0bFc5ajFFTktYZXQzQXBtLUZlUXdNa1ZURE9YMElnMWZmM1ZTSWN3dHpGaHQ0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBM